url: "https://github.com/kazuru-chidumbwe/livepatch-differential-harness/tree/v0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  Differential test harness for Linux livepatch build pipelines (LivepatchDiff
  case study on Linux v6.6.47). Combines ELF relocation triage, structural
  PLT32 bind checks, loadable mutants, and per-case runtime predicates.
  Modules build from source against a pinned kernel; Docker stages separate
  module build from predicate replay.
keywords:
  - livepatch
  - Linux
  - differential testing
  - kpatch
  - package
